  "question": {
    "text": "The area of the region enclosed by the curve&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi>max</mi><mo>{</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>}</mo><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8804;</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></math>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo></math>axis is"
  },
