  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Plotting the required diagram we get,</p><p><img src=\"assets\\st0044_759982db7635.png\" style=\"width: 350px; height: 257px;\" /></p><p>Now from diagram we can say that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is maximum for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;is maximum for&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#8746;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, area of the region is given by,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi></msubsup><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>4</mn></mfrac></msubsup><mi>cos</mi><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math></p><p>Hence this is the required option.</p></blockquote>"
  }
